  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>An ultra-soft angled brush for effortless cream bronzer application and blending. <b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Cream<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Made of vegan, synthetic fibers, this custom-made brush provides flawless application, effortless blending, and a smooth, seamless finish for your favorite cream bronzer.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Lightly tap the brush into your favorite cream bronzer.<br>-Apply where the sun naturally hits your face&mdash;cheekbones, the bridge of the nose, and forehead.</div></details>",
